WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.370
Since protests started over Mahsa Amini,

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.004
's death,

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.605
Iran's regime has unleashed

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:07.574
a campaign of repression.

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:08.241
Eyewitnesses

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.143
tell CNN that sexual violence

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:10.777
is being used

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:11.878
to suppress,

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.546
demoralize and in some cases

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.715
blackmail protesters.

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:16.583
CNN's Nima

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.718
Elbagir has this exclusive report.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:19.919
But we want to warn you

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:20.954
the report contains

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:23.056
details of sexual violence

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.796
Over these mountains is Iran,

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:31.898
a regime that has succeeded

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:33.566
in cutting many of its people

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.702
off from the outside world.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.137
But disturbing stories

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:38.471
detailing the authorities

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:40.073
brutal retribution,

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.741
systematic sexual violence

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.043
against anti-regime

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:45.445
protesters have begun leaking out

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.414
We've come here

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:48.982
to the Kurdish region of Iraq

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.851
to try and find out more.

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:54.421
This is Hannah, not her real name.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:55.555
A Kurdish

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:56.322
Iranian woman

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.358
recently smuggled out of Iran.

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:00.326
She fears for her life

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:02.429
after

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:03.663
taking off and burning

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.598
her headscarf on the streets.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:06.699
She was arrested

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:07.500
and detained

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.969
by Iranian intelligence officers.

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:10.503
They choose

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:11.638
the women who are pretty

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.540
and suited their appetites.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.340
Then the officer

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.208
would take one of them

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.610
from the cell to a smaller private room.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:20.280
They would sexually assault them there.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.415
Hannah isn't only an eyewitness.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.918
She also was violated

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.986
I feel shy talking about this.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.322
You can still see what the policeman did.

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.857
Look here on my neck.

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:32.158
It's purplish.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:33.726
That is why I'm covering it.

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.528
He forced himself on me.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:36.496
Then a fight

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.598
broke out with another protester

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.600
drawing away Hannah's attacker.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.103
Hannah and others could hear screams,

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.137
and they believe

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.271
a woman was raped

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.140
in an interrogation room.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.008
Hannah sketched out the police station

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:50.210
as she remembers it.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.278
She estimates

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.613
70 to 80 men

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.715
and women were together in a main hall

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:56.583
that accessed

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.651
four private interrogation rooms.

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.321
It was in these interrogation room.

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:03.323
She says, that she was assaulted

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:06.126
and others were raped.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:08.394
CNN was able to locate the police station

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:09.629
through Hannah's description

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.064
eyewitness corroboration

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.466
and geolocation using key landmarks

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:16.002
It's in the Islamabad neighborhood

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.270
of Urmia.

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:18.938
Based on this testimony

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:21.074
and speaking to a number of sources,

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:23.676
a pattern of repression comes into focus.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.479
Police centers used as filtration points,

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:27.914
moving protesters

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:30.016
from one location to another.

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:31.117
Often, families

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:32.118
left not knowing

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:35.121
where their loved ones are held.

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:36.556
One Iraq based Kurdish

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:37.490
militant opposition

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:41.227
party PAC identified over 240 people

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.395
who they believe

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:43.363
are missing

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.832
within this maze of detention centers.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:46.933
Human rights

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:47.767
organizations

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:49.502
believe the number is higher

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:51.437
in the thousands.

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:54.007
Some of the victims as young as 14.

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:55.575
Many are men

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:57.810
supporting female protesters.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.480
Their punishment as severe as the women's

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:02.582
rescuers.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:03.483
They brought four

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:04.117
men over

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.752
who'd been beaten, screaming

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.554
intensely in another cell.

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:09.355
And one of the men who was tortured

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.590
sent to the waiting room

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.791
where I was

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:12.425
I asked him

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:14.360
what all that screaming was about.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.729
He said they are raped in the men

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:18.698
based on witness testimony.

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:20.066
CNN traced the location

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:21.234
to an Iranian army

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:23.102
intelligence headquarters

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:25.171
voiced here by a translator.

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:25.872
A 17 year

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:26.506
old boy sent

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:27.941
CNN a voice note

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:29.642
following his imprisonment.

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:30.910
We are withholding his name

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.980
and location for his safety.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.281
When a security guard heard me

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:37.383
discussing the rape of the other inmates.

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:39.485
He started torturing me all over again.

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:42.522
They tortured, raped me from behind.

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:44.524
Even as authorities visited

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:46.626
sexual violence on protesters,

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:47.894
regime figures accused

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:49.028
female protesters

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:50.196
of prostitution

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:52.699
of, quote, wanting to be naked.

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.201
Of the incidents of sexual violence

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:56.469
against protesters

00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:58.871
inside Iranian detention facilities.

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:00.073
Most occurred

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:00.707
in the Kurdish

00:04:00.707 --> 00:04:03.776
majority areas to the west of Iran, home

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:06.412
to a historically oppressed minority.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:08.815
Disturbingly, in some cases,

00:04:08.815 --> 00:04:09.916
the rapes were filmed

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:11.851
and used to blackmail protesters

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:12.785
into silence.

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:16.923
There has been a real escalation

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:18.458
where female protesters

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.260
are, as you can see here,

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.630
being openly assaulted, often sexually

00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:27.033
But the violence against women

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.201
like the protests,

00:04:28.201 --> 00:04:30.570
are not confined to the Kurdish areas.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.972
They are often focused on locations

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:35.241
where the protests are most intense.

00:04:35.475 --> 00:04:37.510
Like here in the capital, Tehran.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.779
Well, do Samer, have you seen during

00:04:39.846 --> 00:04:40.980
one of these stories?

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.849
Is Amitabh Aziz

00:04:42.849 --> 00:04:45.084
a typical 20 year old on social media,

00:04:45.151 --> 00:04:48.054
sharing her love of animals and not less?

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:50.957
I write about it

00:04:50.957 --> 00:04:52.191
in social media posts

00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:53.793
appearing under her name.

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:54.527
Abasi,

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:57.130
like many young women in Iran, criticized

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.698
the regime openly

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:00.867
after the protests began.

00:05:00.867 --> 00:05:02.201
Unlike most,

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:04.337
she did it without anonymity.

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:07.073
It didn't take long for security forces

00:05:07.073 --> 00:05:08.975
to find and arrest her.

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:10.576
Abasi disappeared

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:13.346
soon after whistleblowers began

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:14.314
to post on various

00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:17.383
social media platforms, medics sharing

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:18.451
eyewitness accounts

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:20.520
of what had been done to Abasi.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:21.721
First of all,

00:05:21.721 --> 00:05:22.522
they say

00:05:22.522 --> 00:05:23.956
there were a few plainclothes

00:05:23.956 --> 00:05:24.624
men with her,

00:05:24.624 --> 00:05:25.858
and they did not let her

00:05:25.858 --> 00:05:27.160
out of their sight,

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:27.960
even during

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.229
a private medical examination.

00:05:30.363 --> 00:05:32.865
They were that she was my patient

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:34.734
I went to her bedside.

00:05:34.734 --> 00:05:36.569
They had shaved her hair.

00:05:36.569 --> 00:05:38.571
She was scared and was trembling.

00:05:39.405 --> 00:05:41.674
When she first came in, they said it was

00:05:41.674 --> 00:05:44.010
rectal bleeding due to repeated rape.

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:45.378
The plainclothes

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:47.180
men insisted that the doctor write

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.481
that the rape was from prior

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:49.215
to her arrest,

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:51.651
and then after this issue was becoming

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:53.086
obvious to all

00:05:53.086 --> 00:05:53.953
They changed

00:05:53.953 --> 00:05:55.988
the entire scenario altogether.

00:05:57.156 --> 00:05:58.991
The details of these leaks were confirmed

00:05:58.991 --> 00:06:01.027
to CNN by an insider at Imam

00:06:01.027 --> 00:06:02.028
Ali Hospital,

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:04.163
where Abasi was brought to be examined.

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:05.398
In a statement,

00:06:05.398 --> 00:06:06.165
the government said

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:09.235
Abasi was treated for digestive problems.

00:06:10.036 --> 00:06:11.371
The medics who treated her

00:06:11.371 --> 00:06:14.073
said that was not true.

00:06:14.073 --> 00:06:16.342
The Iranian regime denies the rape,

00:06:16.642 --> 00:06:18.911
accusing her of leading process

00:06:19.245 --> 00:06:20.179
an allegation

00:06:20.179 --> 00:06:21.280
which could see her

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:22.915
face the death penalty

00:06:25.017 --> 00:06:25.551
at this

00:06:25.551 --> 00:06:27.320
usually busy border crossing

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.621
between Iraq and Iran,

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:30.857
it is deceptively quiet,

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:32.592
those who can cross.

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:32.959
Tell us

00:06:32.959 --> 00:06:35.228
the noose is tightening on protesters.

00:06:36.295 --> 00:06:38.431
Authorities have for decades

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:40.166
used sexual torture

00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:41.234
against Iranians,

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:43.202
and it appears once more

00:06:43.202 --> 00:06:44.804
a familiar pattern

00:06:44.804 --> 00:06:47.240
sexual violence deployed to enforce

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.776
an assertion of moral guardianship

00:06:53.646 --> 00:06:54.514
Bianca,

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:55.481
we have reached out

00:06:55.481 --> 00:06:56.749
to Iranian authorities

00:06:56.749 --> 00:06:57.884
and they have not responded

00:06:57.884 --> 00:06:58.985
to our requests for comment.

00:06:58.985 --> 00:07:01.087
But for many of those that we're speaking

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:02.555
to, their actions

00:07:02.555 --> 00:07:04.590
specifically over the last few days

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:05.191
speak louder

00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:07.093
really than any of their words could.

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:08.060
They are engaged

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:09.629
in a continued

00:07:09.629 --> 00:07:12.365
horrifying, militarized escalation

00:07:12.632 --> 00:07:14.400
in the Kurdish majority regions

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:14.901
to the west

00:07:14.901 --> 00:07:17.970
where we tracked many of those rapes to.

00:07:18.204 --> 00:07:18.905
They also are

00:07:18.905 --> 00:07:20.840
engaged in an attempt

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.810
to blackout communication even further.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.711
What is really extraordinary,

00:07:25.711 --> 00:07:27.780
not only about the bravery of those men

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.581
and women

00:07:28.581 --> 00:07:30.349
who were able to send us

00:07:30.349 --> 00:07:30.950
voice notes,

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:31.717
who are able

00:07:31.717 --> 00:07:32.952
to get their stories

00:07:32.952 --> 00:07:34.954
and their voices out to us

00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:36.422
and to the rest of the world

00:07:36.422 --> 00:07:39.025
is that they did this in the face

00:07:39.325 --> 00:07:41.594
of an increasing escalation of

00:07:41.594 --> 00:07:43.563
of an increasing attempt

00:07:43.563 --> 00:07:44.831
by Iranian authorities

00:07:44.831 --> 00:07:45.765
to block them

00:07:45.765 --> 00:07:47.133
and to silence them

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:48.701
and really to encircle them

00:07:48.701 --> 00:07:50.169
from the rest of the world.

00:07:50.169 --> 00:07:50.970
The sad thing

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.171
is there really doesn't

00:07:52.171 --> 00:07:55.107
seem to be any respite on the horizon.

00:07:55.107 --> 00:07:56.409
It's very clear

00:07:56.409 --> 00:07:58.044
that the Iranian authorities view

00:07:58.044 --> 00:07:58.778
what is happening,

00:07:58.778 --> 00:08:01.347
especially in those minority areas.

00:08:01.347 --> 00:08:02.915
In the west, in the Kurdish west

00:08:02.915 --> 00:08:04.984
as an existential threat. The anchor.

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:06.986
Nima Elbagir,

00:08:06.986 --> 00:08:07.887
thank you so much for

00:08:07.887 --> 00:08:09.255
that exclusive report.

